stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PRE
  PRE --> DENIED: hard gate or utility deny
  PRE --> HUMAN_PENDING: human required
  PRE --> AUTHORIZED: allowed
  HUMAN_PENDING --> AUTHORIZED: exact intent approved
  HUMAN_PENDING --> CANCELLED: rejected
  AUTHORIZED --> QUEUED: offline and queueable
  AUTHORIZED --> EXECUTING: guards revalidated
  AUTHORIZED --> EXPIRED: mandate expired
  QUEUED --> EXECUTING: online + revalidated
  QUEUED --> EXPIRED: TTL expired
  EXECUTING --> SUCCEEDED: known success
  EXECUTING --> FAILED: known no effect/failure
  EXECUTING --> AMBIGUOUS: unknown effect
  AMBIGUOUS --> RECONCILING
  RECONCILING --> SUCCEEDED: intended effect observed
  RECONCILING --> FAILED: no effect proven
  RECONCILING --> HUMAN_PENDING: inconclusive/budget exhausted
  FAILED --> AUTHORIZED: safe retry + budget
  SUCCEEDED --> VERIFYING
  VERIFYING --> VERIFIED: postconditions + confidence
  VERIFYING --> RECONCILING: more observation
  VERIFYING --> ROLLBACK_PENDING: harmful effect
  VERIFIED --> COMMITTED
  ROLLBACK_PENDING --> ROLLED_BACK
